>  Is there a situation where 1) {lo ca tcika du xo} is different from and/or
> preferable to {ma ca tcika}? 2) {lo ca tcika du xo} is not malrarbau?

I cannot think of any such cases. {ma ca tcika} is
recommended, I just pointed out that {le tcika du xo}
was incorrect.

> That still groups as (lo vomoi) jo'u (lo mumoi pe LFB). To get the
> other grouping you need {vu'o}: {(lo vomoi jo'u lo mumoi) vu'o pe LFB}.

> You could also join them at the brivla level:
> {lo (vomoi jo'u mumoi) pagbu be LFB}

Yeah, You're right.

> Actually, {li xo} was correct, but you need {cu}:
> {le tcika cu du li xo} or {le tcika cu du ma}.

> {xo} is a digit, so you need {li} to make a sumti out of it.

Ah. Every day I learn something from You. :)

